HAI SHOR JIN-O-BASHAR ME PAIHAM MALAK BHI AANSU BAHA RAHE HAI<br>
HUSSAIN KU KARBALA ME ZALIM LAAHU KE AANSU BAHA RAHE HAI<br>
<br>
1.Jigar Ko Thame Hai Anbiya Bhi Ajeeb Manzar Hai Karbala Me<br>
Gul-e-Shahadat Se Ibne Zehra Zameen-e-Karbal Sajara Rahe Hai<br>
<br>
2.Kahan Ho Ayub Aakey Dekho Pidar Ke Kandhe Pe Laashe Akber<br>
Zayeef Todhti Kamar Ku Kas Ke Jawan Ka Laasha Utha Rahe Hai<br>
<br>
3.Khadi Hai Dewdi Ke Dar Pe Laila Nazar Jhukaye Jigar Ko Thame<br>
Jawan Bete Ki Laash Utha Ke Hussain Maqtal Se Aarahe Hai<br>
<br>
4.Sakina Kehti Hai Ro Ke Baba Sulalo Seene Pe Mujh Ku Apne<br>
Na Aaya Wapis Koi Bhi Abtak Jo Run Ko Qaime Se Jarahe Hai<br>
<br>
5.Hai Aale-e-Ahmed Me Taza Maishar Kaleja Pakdhe Khadi Hai Zainab<br>
Chadha Ke Naize Pe Farq-e-Sarwar Laiyeen Khushiyan Mana Rahe Hai<br>
<br>
6.Hai Loot Qaimou Me Shah-eDeen Ke Nazar Me Har Su Dhuwa Dhuwa Ha<br>
Kisi Ki Masnath Kisi Ka Bistar Kisi Ka Jhoola Jaala Rahe Hai<br>
<br>
7.Hussain Ro Ro Ke Sun Rahe Hai Yeh Karwan-e-Aza Se Nouha<br>
Tumhara Nouha Haram Me Mazhar Tadhap Ke Mehdi Suna Rahe Hai
